  "instructions": [
    "heat 1 tablespoon of coconut oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "add the panang curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "add the tofu and cook for 3-4 minutes, or until heated through.",
    "add the sugar snap peas and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until tender.",
    "stir in the pickled carrots and cucumber.",
    "serve the curry over jasmine rice in a copper mug.",
    "top with toasted coconut flakes, if using"
